<h3>Booking Confirmation</h3>

<p>Dear <%= @passenger.name %>,</p>

<p>Your booking has been confirmed.</p>

<p>Booking details:</p>

<ul>
    <li>Booking ID: <%= @booking.id %></li>
    <li>Flight: <%= @booking.flight.departure_airport.airport_code %> - <%= @booking.flight.arrival_airport.airport_code %></li>
    <li>Departure Time: <%= @booking.flight.start.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M") %></li>
    <li>Duration: <%= @booking.flight.duration %> minutes</li>
</ul>

<p>Thank you for booking with us. We look forward to seeing you on your flight.</p>

<p>Best regards,</p>

<p>The Flight Booking Team</p>